;
; How Silt files a record in its case file tree, in MYRA (silt_rules.h
; SR4): series, case, then the document's place in the case, holding the
; record's register number, its date (days since 1970) and its legal hold
; flag. The model asks whether the numbers fit before it writes the
; register line.
^ZXSILT(series:i4, caseno:i6, doc:i4) = regno:i10! ^ dated:i6! ^ hold:i1!
